# Preview UI Changes

Whenever you touch any frontend files (edit, create, or delete matching the globs above), invoke the **preview-ui-changes** skill before finishing:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/preview-ui-changes/SKILL.md`.
2. Do not end the turn with code-only changes — open the app in the Cursor browser and show how it looks (screenshot in the reply).
3. One preview pass after a coherent batch of related frontend edits is enough; do not skip the preview entirely.
